Your program needs to recognize that the missing value, currency formatting, and unusually large number could affect its analysis.
This is important because bad input produces misleading output.
4. Automating the analysis
You don't want to write a separate analysis script for every dataset.
Instead, you want a system that dynamically decides what analysis to perform.
